1
00:00:07,240 --> 00:00:11,200
The Black Gate of Mordor.

2
00:00:15,440 --> 00:00:16,880
Save us.

3
00:00:56,800 --> 00:01:00,640
- I do not ask you to come with me, Sam.
- I know, Mr. Frodo.

4
00:01:01,080 --> 00:01:04,440
I doubt even these Elvish
cloaks will hide us in there.

5
00:01:04,560 --> 00:01:07,720
No! No! No!

6
00:01:07,840 --> 00:01:09,080
No, master!

7
00:01:09,200 --> 00:01:12,520
They'll catch you! They'll catch you!

8
00:01:12,840 --> 00:01:16,680
No! Don't take it to him!

9
00:01:21,920 --> 00:01:26,200
There's another way.
More secret. A dark way.

10
00:01:26,280 --> 00:01:28,320
Why haven't you spoken of this before?

11
00:01:28,440 --> 00:01:30,480
Because master did not ask.

12
00:01:30,600 --> 00:01:31,840
He's up to something.

13
00:01:31,920 --> 00:01:34,680
Are you saying there's
another way into Mordor?

14
00:01:35,000 --> 00:01:40,280
Yes. There's a path, and stairs,

15
00:01:40,440 --> 00:01:44,680
and then... a tunnel.

16
00:01:46,880 --> 00:01:49,080
Lead the way, Sméagol.
